      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Rung 3 \u2014 `otelc go build`\n`main.go` has **0** OpenTelemetry imports and `go.mod` has **0** OTel dependencies. Everything below came from changing one word in the build command.\n\nNote the **resource** on a span here: `otelc` auto-detects host, OS, process and runtime attributes that demos 1 and 2 never set."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "The whole change: go build became otelc go build."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces \u2014 check the resource attributes, not just the span",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"demo3-compile-time\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "description": "Spans from a binary whose source never mentions OpenTelemetry. Open the resource: 12 attributes, all detected automatically."
    },
