      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### The honest gap\nThere is **no HTTP request-duration metric** on this dashboard, and that is not an oversight. `otelc` v1 auto-instruments `net/http` for **traces only**.\n\nCompare with demo 2, which gets three HTTP histograms from one wrapper call. *Zero-code* means a curated library list, not everything."
      },
      "id": 7,
      "description": "Why there is no HTTP request-duration metric anywhere on this page."
